      <description>&lt;p&gt;Here you can add additional context, description, links, etc.&#xA;The content you see here comes from the contents of the &lt;code&gt;content/projects&lt;/code&gt; folder.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This project is in the file &lt;code&gt;projects/swiss-fintech.md&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In the markdown file frontmatter you can also define additional parameters, such as the link:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight-wrapper&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button class=&#34;copy-code-btn&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; aria-label=&#34;Copy code to clipboard&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;rect x=&#34;9&#34; y=&#34;9&#34; width=&#34;13&#34; height=&#34;13&#34; rx=&#34;2&#34; ry=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;/rect&gt;&#xA;      &lt;path d=&#34;M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;copy-text&#34;&gt;Copy&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-text&#34; data-lang=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;link: &amp;#34;https://www.adrianmoreno.info&amp;#34; # optional URL to link the logo to&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;params:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    button:&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        icon: &amp;#34;icon-arrow-right&amp;#34;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        btnText: &amp;#34;Case Study&amp;#34;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        URL: &amp;#34;https://www.adrianmoreno.info&amp;#34;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    image:  &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        x: &amp;#34;images/works/swissfintech.jpg&amp;#34;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;        _2x: &amp;#34;images/works/swissfintech@2x.jpg&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
